# Cargo -> Logistics
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCargo = cargo tech jumpsuit
    .desc = A sturdy jumpsuit, issued to members of the Logistics department.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitQM = logistics officer's jumpsuit
    .desc = 'What can brown do for you?'

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitQMTurtleneck = logistics officer's turtleneck
    .desc = A sharp turtleneck made for the hardy work environment of supply.

# Rewritten for tone
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitEngineering = engineering jumpsuit
    .desc = Lightly dusted with soot and debris from long repair jobs.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoP = head of personnel's jumpsuit
    .desc = You're the person in charge of the uniforms. If your own uniform was anything less than exceptional, it'd be a disgrace!

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoSGrey = head of security's grey jumpsuit
    .desc = A grey jumpsuit for the Head of Security to help them blend in with the passengers a little.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitBrigmedic = combat medic jumpsuit
    .desc = This uniform is issued to qualified personnel who have been trained. Infamously hard to keep clean.

# Lore related rewrites
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSecGrey = grey security jumpsuit
    .desc = A tactical relic of years past before Cybersun decided it was cheaper to tell SyndComm to dye the suits red instead of washing out the blood.

ent-ClothingUniformSecurityTrooper = trooper uniform
    .desc = A formal uniform issued to the SyndComm Troopers; usually it comes with a car.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitWarden = warden's uniform
    .desc = A formal security suit for officers, complete with SyndComm belt buckle.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPyjamaSyndicateBlack = black syndicate pyjamas
    .desc = Perfect for lounging around on the floor and gossiping with friends.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPyjamaSyndicatePink = pink syndicate pyjamas
    .desc = Perfect for lounging around on the floor and gossiping with friends.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPyjamaSyndicateRed = red syndicate pyjamas
    .desc = Perfect for lounging around on the floor and gossiping with friends.

ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSyndieFormal = syndicate formal suit
    .desc = The upper echelons of Syndicate bureaucracy are all about making the right impression, which always starts with the right outfit. This one reads something like "I'm in charge here."

# More generic names
